438	     * {@link #getMemberId() memberId} (the two digits following the REGION prefix) as {@code FY<YY>},
439	     * where the fiscal year starts on 1 July and {@code YY} is the last two digits of the fiscal
440	     * year (the calendar year in which it ends). Because the member id embeds the fiscal year of the
441	     * business-day-adjusted {@link #registrationDate} at creation, the value tracks the member id.
442	     * {@code null} when the owner has no member id. Not persisted.
443	     */
444	    public String getFiscalYear() {
445	        if (this.memberId == null) {
446	            return null;
447	        }
448	        int start = getLocality().length();
449	        if (this.memberId.length() < start + 2) {
450	            return null;
