480	    /**
481	     * The fixed city-to-region mapping ({@code Sydney -> NSW}, {@code Melbourne -> VIC},
482	     * {@code Brisbane -> QLD}): the region for {@code city}, or {@code null} when the city is not in
483	     * the table. Used only by postcode validation, which branches on "known region or not" by testing
484	     * for {@code null} before range-checking the postcode.
