516	     * {@link #getMemberId() memberId} (the leading run of letters before the two-digit fiscal year).
517	     * Because the member id is assigned as {@code <REGION><FY><HASH8><CHK>} with REGION taken from the
518	     * postcode, the locality follows the same region-and-hash identity as the member id.
